// ================================================================
//   SUPER HAZOOM: LIBERTY CITY
//   Written in HAZOOM BASIC — A Retro 8-Bit Adventure
//   (c) HAZOOM OS — Building = Healing
// ================================================================
//
//   HAZOOM is the hero — a shadow builder exploring Liberty City.
//   Collect coins, avoid enemies, grab power-ups, survive.
//   This game runs on the HAZOOM BASIC virtual console.
//
// MEMORY MAP:
//   TILE 0  = Empty
//   TILE 1  = Brick wall
//   TILE 2  = Ground
//   TILE 3  = ? Block (power-up)
//   TILE 4  = Pipe top
//   TILE 5  = Pipe body
//   TILE 6  = Coin
//   TILE 7  = Cloud
//   TILE 8  = Bush
//   TILE 9  = Building
//   TILE 10 = Window
//   TILE 11 = Road
//   TILE 12 = Sidewalk
//   TILE 13 = Car
//   TILE 14 = Police car
//   TILE 15 = Star power-up
//
// SPRITES:
//   SPRITE 0 = HAZOOM (player)
//   SPRITE 1-4 = Enemies (Shadow agents)
//   SPRITE 5 = Coin
//   SPRITE 6 = Star
//   SPRITE 7 = Vehicle
//
// CONTROLS:
//   LEFT/RIGHT or A/D = Move
//   UP/W or SPACE/Z = Jump
//   ENTER = Start/Pause

